\hypertarget{search-page-searchsearch.jsx}{%
\paragraph{4.4.3 Search Page
(Search/Search.jsx)}\label{search-page-searchsearch.jsx}}

\textbf{Purpose}: Property search and listing display.

\textbf{Key Features}: - Fetches services from backend API - Implements
filtering by location, price, amenities - Displays results in grid
layout using ListingCard components - Handles loading states and empty
results - Integrates with ServiceModal for detailed views

\textbf{Data Flow}: 1. Fetch services from /api/services endpoint 2.
Transform backend data to frontend format 3. Apply client-side filters
4. Render filtered results 5. Handle user interactions (view details,
book, save)

\hypertarget{payment-page-paymentpayment.jsx}{%
\paragraph{4.4.4 Payment Page
(Payment/Payment.jsx)}\label{payment-page-paymentpayment.jsx}}

\textbf{Purpose}: Multi-step payment process for property bookings.

\textbf{Step Structure}: 1. Personal Information: User details
collection 2. Payment Method: Payment option selection 3. Confirmation:
Review and submit

\textbf{Payment Flow}: 1. Validate service ID and user authentication 2.
Create booking via POST /api/bookings 3. Process payment via POST
/api/payments 4. Handle success/error responses 5. Navigate to dashboard
on completion

\textbf{Components}: - PaymentStepIndicator: Progress visualization -
PersonalInfoStep: Personal details form - PaymentMethodStep: Payment
method selection - ConfirmationStep: Final review - PaymentSidebar:
Booking summary - FormNavigation: Step navigation controls

\hypertarget{dashboard-page-dashboarddashboard.jsx}{%
\paragraph{4.4.5 Dashboard Page
(Dashboard/Dashboard.jsx)}\label{dashboard-page-dashboarddashboard.jsx}}

\textbf{Purpose}: User dashboard with multiple views and
functionalities.

\textbf{Dashboard Views}: - Overview: Summary statistics and recent
activity - MyListings: User's property listings management -
PaymentHistory: Transaction history and details - Wishlist: Saved
properties - Profile: User profile management

\textbf{State Management}: - activeView: Current dashboard section -
userData: User profile information - listings: User's property listings
- payments: Payment transaction history - wishlist: Saved properties
list

\hypertarget{service-provision-page-provideserviceprovideservice.jsx}{%
\paragraph{4.4.6 Service Provision Page
(ProvideService/ProvideService.jsx)}\label{service-provision-page-provideserviceprovideservice.jsx}}

\textbf{Purpose}: Multi-step form for property listing creation.

\textbf{Form Steps}: 1. Basic Information: Title, type, description 2.
Location Details: Address and area information 3. Pricing \&
Availability: Rent and date ranges 4. Property Details: Bedrooms,
bathrooms, features 5. Amenities \& Features: Available facilities 6.
Photos \& Contact: Images and contact information 7. Review \& Submit:
Final review before submission

\textbf{Form Management}: - Comprehensive form validation - Step-by-step
navigation - Data persistence across steps - Image upload handling -
Error handling and user feedback

\hypertarget{reusable-components-clientsrccomponents}{%
\subsubsection{4.5 Reusable Components
(Client/src/components/)}\label{reusable-components-clientsrccomponents}}

